@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam rectangleRoundCorner 8
rectangle "阶段 0\n集成并重设基线" as P0
rectangle "阶段 1\n标量语义与\nGFB 执行基础" as P1
rectangle "阶段 2\n有界信号\n纵向切片" as P2
rectangle "阶段 3\n调度计划与用量核算" as P3
rectangle "阶段 4\n约束、资源与\n连续控制" as P4
rectangle "阶段 5\n导入、组合\n与宏" as P5
rectangle "阶段 6\n设置、观测、\n重放、热替换" as P6
rectangle "阶段 7\n外部边界审计\n（23 个用例）" as P7
rectangle "阶段 8\n最终验收" as P8
P0 --> P1
P1 --> P2 : Duration/Result 类型
P1 ..> P3
P1 ..> P4
P1 ..> P5
P3 ..> P4 : 用量核算
P1 --> P6
P2 --> P6
P3 --> P6
P4 --> P6
P5 --> P6 : 稳定的描述符
P6 --> P7 : 稳定的清单与\n观测 schema
P7 --> P8
note right of P3 : 还需要 Date/Time、\n设置事件、账本
note right of P4 : 还需要设置
note right of P5 : 需要稳定的类型/清单/\n源身份标识
@enduml
